+// The Screen property against the monorepo's vt emulator (part 2 of the rewrite: it keeps the
+// old harness, generators and known-bug gates of the committed test until then), moved
+// byte for byte from the old hegel_test.go together with the old helpers it still needs: the
+// old property wrapper with its CELLBUF_COLLECT collect mode, fail, count/stats, n, chance,
+// pick, note, the old draw helpers genGrapheme/genColor/genStyleOpt/genLink/genCellOpt/genRect
+// over the raw atom lists, and the replay helpers. The names did not clash with the new
+// harness (hegel_test.go has hegelOpts, which this property's wrapper now shares; the new
+// harness counts through hzTally and hzStats), so nothing is renamed. The pins of part 2
+// (hegel_pins_test.go) use uvStyleString and replayLine from here.
